cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "phat-tails: Pareto Hybrids with Asymmetric Tails"
abstract: >-
  The Phat distribution is a two-tailed, fully continuous probability
  distribution for data with heavy tails on both sides: an equal-weight
  mixture of the hybrid Pareto distribution of Carreau and Bengio and its
  reflection. The package provides the distribution, maximum-likelihood and
  two-stage fits, a Hill double-bootstrap estimator of the tail shapes, and
  a simulator of ARMA-GARCH forecasts with Phat innovations.
authors:
  - family-names: Skene
    given-names: Ryan
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rjskene/phat"
url: "https://phat.readthedocs.io"
keywords:
  - heavy tails
  - extreme value theory
  - generalized Pareto distribution
  - hybrid Pareto
  - mixture distribution
  - GARCH
